{
  "id": 1228,
  "description": "To members who look here! \n-Frostbite Summit raid 5pm CST Friday/Saturdays, if there is a day that works better message me I&#039;ll make sure we figure something out so everyone gets the ability to partake. \n-great job on the donations guys! We&#039;re close to our guild Hall!\n\nTo people interested in joining!\n-Started this guild for all the new players that can&#039;t find a home elsewhere. \nHere&#039;s your starter home we&#039;ll grow as a team and you can move on to bigger and better guilds or help me grow this one from the ground up. \n\nI&#039;m not giving hard deadlines on being kicked, I&#039;ll keep an eye on activity and that type of thing, but I&#039;m not quick to put on the boot. So ask questions and enjoy the slow build this game offers!\n\nTips for everyone. \n-Always have a reserve of Coal.\n-Don&#039;t stagnate your growth for the guild lol !!!!!!!\n-Have resources left over to build up skills like smelting and forging. \n-equip armor (either from the market, or forging. The market is cheap and a few sold coal will get you equipped to start) \n-upgrade your harvesting equipment when you have the cash to do so, the 5/10/15% speed bonuses for the starter ones are a great boost. \n-try to get your combat level to 40, as when we have a couple people strong enough, we can do raids/bossfight.\n-fishing is essential to battling and so is cooking, these need to be leveled and a stockpile of cooked fish should be kept for battles to start. \n-pets are very important, sell stuff on the market, get cash and buy as many different pets as you can and get them hunting for you. Builds up pet mastery much faster as well. \n-remember to donate and activate your boost shrine as well. \n-have fun this isn&#039;t a race and games like this are long term investments, enjoy the grind.",
